/// `BlockingEcho` under a name only `TelemetryTest` uses: `TelemetryCollector`
/// keeps the events whose `#handler` is this class, so events from other
/// test classes' servers, which run at the same time, are not counted.
BlockingEcho subclass: TelemetryBlockingEcho
